() Tj
T*
(They tell the generator where an edge should sample vertices from.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(community/subcommunity = hidden source pool) Tj
T*
(generated hedge/edge = actual selectable coverage set) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Subcommunity A = {1, 2, 3, ..., 80}) Tj
T*
(Generated local edge = {3, 7, 11, 14, ..., 72}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The algorithm can select the generated local edge. It cannot select the) Tj
T*
(subcommunity itself.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Edge Types) Tj
T*
(-------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The generator creates four edge types.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Global Generalist Edges) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Global edges sample a small number of vertices from many communities.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(They represent broad actions such as:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(large campaign) Tj
T*
(wide-area service) Tj
T*
(general recommendation) Tj
T*
(broad sensor/facility) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Global does not necessarily mean largest. It means the edge is diverse across) Tj
T*
(communities.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sampling behavior:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(choose about 65% to 100% of all communities) Tj
T*
(from each chosen community:) Tj
T*
(    sample about 7% of popular vertices) Tj
T*
(    sample about 1.2% of tail vertices) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Community Edges) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Community edges focus on one community, but sample across several) Tj
T*
(subcommunities inside it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sampling behavior:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(choose 1 community) Tj
T*
(choose 2 to all subcommunities inside that community) Tj
T*
(from each chosen subcommunity:) Tj
T*
(    sample about 18% to 35%) Tj
T*
(also sample about 3% of popular vertices from that community) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
