stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 760 Td
14 TL
(### Local Specialist Edges) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Local edges focus deeply on one subcommunity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sampling behavior:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(choose 1 community) Tj
T*
(choose 1 subcommunity) Tj
T*
(sample about 45% to 78% of that subcommunity) Tj
T*
(with 25% probability:) Tj
T*
(    also sample about 6% of a neighboring subcommunity) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Bridge/Noise Edges) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Bridge edges connect two communities with small sampled pieces.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sampling behavior:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(choose 2 different communities) Tj
T*
(choose 1 subcommunity from each) Tj
T*
(sample a small amount from both) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These edges add noise and cross-community overlap.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Edge Size Control) Tj
T*
(--------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The generator controls edge size by sampling rules and a shared maximum cap.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The cap is:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(max_edge_size = max\(60, min\(220, int\(0.055 * nvtxs\)\)\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(So approximately:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(small:  nvtxs = 1200 -> max edge size about 66) Tj
T*
(medium: nvtxs = 2400 -> max edge size about 132) Tj
T*
(large:  nvtxs = 4800 -> max edge size about 220) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(No edge type is guaranteed to be larger than another.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The edge type controls coverage pattern:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(global    = wide and shallow) Tj
T*
(community = medium-scale within one community) Tj
T*
(local     = narrow and deep) Tj
T*
(bridge    = small cross-community) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(All edge types are clipped if they exceed `max_edge_size`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Stochasticity) Tj
T*
(----------------) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
