() Tj
T*
(The graph is stochastic because every run randomly changes:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(which communities a global edge touches) Tj
T*
(which vertices are sampled) Tj
T*
(which community a community edge chooses) Tj
T*
(which subcommunities a community edge touches) Tj
T*
(how deep each local edge is) Tj
T*
(whether a local edge touches a neighbor) Tj
T*
(which two communities a bridge edge connects) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(So every instance has the same broad structure, but not the same exact edges.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This is more natural than the tailored bait graph because there is no exact) Tj
T*
(known optimum and no hand-coded winning solution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Why Greedy Can Struggle) Tj
T*
(--------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Greedy repeatedly picks the edge with the largest current uncovered gain.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(On this graph, greedy can over-select:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(broad global edges) Tj
T*
(community edges that cover popular/common regions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These choices look good early, but they can overlap later. Greedy cannot undo) Tj
T*
(earlier decisions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The result is usually not a huge failure, because greedy is strong. But it can) Tj
T*
(leave modest improvement opportunities.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Why hMETIS Helps) Tj
T*
(-------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(hMETIS partitions vertices, but MCP selects edges. To use hMETIS, the graph is) Tj
T*
(written in reverse:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(hMETIS vertex = original MCP edge/set) Tj
T*
(hMETIS hyperedge = original MCP vertex/element) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If two MCP edges cover many of the same vertices, they appear together in many) Tj
T*
(hMETIS hyperedges. That makes them structurally connected.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In the natural hierarchy graph:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(local edges from the same subcommunity overlap) Tj
T*
(community edges inside the same community overlap) Tj
T*
(global edges overlap on popular vertices) Tj
T*
(bridge edges connect communities) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(hMETIS can detect this structure indirectly through overlap. It is not given) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
