(14. Best Final Claim) Tj
T*
(--------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The most defensible claim is:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(> Tabu gives the best final solution quality. However, hMETIS-refinement gives a) Tj
T*
(> faster structure-aware improvement over greedy. On larger hierarchical) Tj
T*
(> community graphs, it captures a substantial portion of tabu's improvement) Tj
T*
